Referenced third-party components
---------------------------------

The kit writes configuration that tells an MCP client to launch the components
below. They are separate programs, run as separate processes and fetched by
the client at the pinned version. None of their code is included in this
package. Each is under its own licence.

Every component in kit.manifest.json must be listed here; a test enforces it.

